data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Categorizing Initial Actions**\n\nI'm initially grouping these L1 action briefs into L2 categories. It seems I can discern a few preliminary task groupings: \"conversation,\" \"observation,\" and \"personal state.\" I am currently considering if these categories are sufficient or if sub-grouping might be more beneficial for future processing.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "AGuiav7AJKmijMcP4e7PwQI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 2247,"totalTokenCount": 2247}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Refining Category Definitions**\n\nI've been refining the categories for these L1 actions. \"Conversation\" is straightforward, but I am expanding \"observation\" to include the various physical glances around the office, like looking at the window, ceiling, desk items, or colleague. The \"personal state\" category is holding for expressions of sleepiness. The \"reading\" action has expanded into reading and looking at documents or screens. I've also added \"watching video\" as a distinct action now.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "AGuiav7AJKmijMcP4e7PwQI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 2247,"totalTokenCount": 2247}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Revising Action Groupings**\n\nI'm now revising the action groupings based on these new examples. I'm separating \"looking around\" from feeling sleepy, grouping the former as an observation and the latter as personal state. I've also clarified the conversational action, and integrated reading/viewing activities. \"Idly observing\" encompasses a range of visual actions, and this could be considered a new L2 action, or a sub-action.\n\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "AGuiav7AJKmijMcP4e7PwQI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 2247,"totalTokenCount": 2247}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Analyzing Action Data**\n\nI'm now analyzing more action data, verifying the L1 indices and constraints. I'm noting specific actions: expressing sleepiness during a conversation, reviewing a document, listening to a colleague while observing desk items, watching a colleague's phone video, and sitting idly, observing desk items, which includes some vocalizations. I am considering these actions to ensure I'm getting the core of each action objective.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "AGuiav7AJKmijMcP4e7PwQI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 2247,"totalTokenCount": 2247}}

